OL,3,GNEWSAMurder probe after woman's body
OL,4,Afound in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched following the discovery of a
OL,8,Fwoman's body in a park.
OL,10,FMerseyside Police were called to
OL,11,FStanley Park in Liverpool at about
OL,12,F17:25 BST and found the body in part of
OL,13,Fa walled garden.
OL,15,FThe force said the body, of a white
OL,16,Fwoman in her 70s, could have been there
OL,17,Ffor a number of weeks.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
